  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I think this is necessary for users who want to leave the instance alone when they fall out of control, such as taking their seats off.\nBy fixing yourself to a specific part of your friend, you always keep a magnetized distance from your friend.\nThis effect continues across instances, and if a friend connected with a magnet moves the instance, the person who made the magnet can automatically move to the destination instance of that friend.\nThis effect continues until the friend logs out or releases the magnet.\nMovement is restricted during the magnet.",
